    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>诺兰回来了。让我们聊一聊他的《奥德赛》。</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：Tilda，资深电影记者，费比西国际影评人，《诺兰变奏曲》译者。</span></strong></p><p><br><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 个人如何评价诺兰这部新片</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 诺兰为什么要选择拍摄《奥德赛》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> 诺兰是当代的库布里克？卢卡斯？黑泽明？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a> 从《奥德赛》原著和改编，聊聊诺兰的英雄史观和身份认同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3940">65:40</a> 诺兰为何能从那一代名导中脱颖而出</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4428">73:48</a> 《奥德赛》在诺兰作品中排序</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4624">77:04</a> 好莱坞史诗片的复兴，以及对于中国史诗大片的启示</span></p><p></p><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><p><span>唐朝、祖占</span></p><p><span>【封面】</span></p><p><span>《奥德赛》剧照</span></p><p><span>【配乐】</span></p><p><span>OP：Ludwig Göransson</span><strong><span> - </span></strong><span>《Chasing the Escaping Sun》（From The Odyssey OMPS）</span></p><p><span>ED：Ludwig Göransson</span><strong><span> - </span></strong><span>《Odysseus》（From The Odyssey OMPS）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
